      "story_intro": "四季轮散场之后，村庄联盟点亮了夜巡的规矩：塔不再只守一季，而要守一夜。考场设在曲河口——两条雪径各自绕过崖壁，从不同的弯同时逼近蛋所。灯组的暗号写在雪上：双河同夜，谁先眨眼？",
      "story_intro_en": "After the season round dispersed, the village league kindled its night-watch code: towers would guard not a season but a whole night. The proving ground lay at Curved River — two snow lanes looping the cliff from opposite bends, closing on the roost from different arcs. A lamp cipher glinted in the snow: two rivers, one night — who blinks first?",
      "story_outro": "两条雪河在黎明前先后力竭，弯口只剩被灯照暖的雪窝。夜巡使收起第一面旗：下一道考题，织机巷的十字灯。",
      "story_outro_en": "Both snow rivers spent themselves before dawn, leaving only a lamp-warmed hollow at the bend. The night marshal struck the first banner: next exam — the cross lanterns of Weft Lane."
    },
