      "story_intro": "葫芦谷的中段细成一握，夜巡把它改成了灯的瓶颈：两条长队从上下两肚同时灌向细腰，谁在腰上站稳，谁就把整谷的光收进一线。艾吉把最重的塔押在喉口——这一夜考的是收束。",
      "story_intro_en": "The waist of Gourd Valley narrows to a handhold, and the watch made of it a bottleneck of lamps: two long columns poured from both bellies at once toward the waist — whoever stands fast at the waist gathers the valley's whole light into a single thread. Eggy anchored the heaviest towers at the throat. Tonight's lesson: convergence.",
      "story_outro": "细腰在两路寒流的撞击里始终亮着，像一根没被掐断的灯芯。谷子空了，光满着——夜巡使向望哨塔吹响了下一角哨。",
      "story_outro_en": "Through both hammering cold-waves the waist kept burning, a wick no thumb could pinch out. The gourd emptied; the light filled — and the marshal's next whistle flew up toward the Spiral Watch."
    },
