      "story_intro": "荒原边缘的旧望哨被夜巡重新点亮：三条盘道绕塔而上，塔心只护一盏灯——而寒流学会了两栖，飞兵趁夜贴着旋外圈直取塔顶。仰望的塔第一次要同时守住脚下与头顶。",
      "story_intro_en": "The old watchtower at the moor's edge was relit by the night watch: three coils wound up around a single lamp at its core — and the cold tide had learned amphibious ways, flyers skimming the spiral's outer dark straight for the crown. For the first time, the tower that had only looked up must guard its foot and its summit at once.",
      "story_outro": "三盘道在塔身上绞成一根亮索，飞兵绕了三匝不得其门。哨塔放行，只朝北方努了努嘴——极夜的冠，正在集合。",
      "story_outro_en": "The three coils twisted up the shaft into one bright hawser; the flyers circled thrice and found no seam. The watchtower let them pass, jerking its beam north — the Polar Crown was assembling."
    },
