      ],
      "story_intro": "极夜的守灯联盟把最终考题铺在雪原：三股寒源自北、东、西三条极径同时南下，各捧一尊冰冕之影。四季轮验过村庄守一季，今夜要验的是——在没有四季的地方，灯能否自成四季。艾吉登上蛋所最高的雪丘，替所有守夜人掌第一盏灯。",
      "story_intro_en": "At the solstice of the polar night the Lampkeepers' league spread its final exam across the snowfields: three cold sources marched south from the north, east and west polar roads, each bearing an ice-crowned shade. The season round had proven the village could keep one season; tonight proves whether, where no seasons reach, a lamp can become four seasons all by itself. Eggy climbed the tallest snow mound to hold the first light for every night watch.",
      "story_outro": "三顶冰冕在黎明前碎成晨露——恰是当年泉庭灯罩上的那种。夜巡归档，卷首只写了一行：灯在，季就在；夜再长，长不过守夜人眨一次眼之间重新亮起的，那一寸光。",
      "story_outro_en": "Before dawn the three ice crowns shattered into morning dew — the very kind once gathered on the spring yard's lamp hood. The night watch filed its record, its first page holding one line only: while the lamp burns, the seasons hold; and no night is longer than the inch of light that rekindles between one blink of the watchkeeper's eye."
